WEBVTT

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.100
<b>Hell</b>

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.020
<b>Hell Bureau of the Peace, Far East Division</b>

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:13.020
<b>Regular Briefing Meeting of Punitive Force Section Chiefs</b>

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.870
With the increase in section chiefs,

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:13.610
we have seen a 230% increase

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:16.910
<b>Counter-Spirit Bureau Chief 
Dokuro Skull</b>

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.910
over last year's rate of capture.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.230
However, we have been pressured 
to make further budget cuts,

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.300
so things will be more difficult.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.890
<i>Have you heard the rumors about</i>

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.520
<i>Vintage worming their way
 into the Loose Souls Team?</i>

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:31.650
In response, I expect all 
section chiefs to step up.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.800
That concludes this meeting—

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.200
I have a question!

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:16.430
<b>Goddess Mix</b>

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:13.260
It has to do with the recent decree

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:16.440
to search for Heavenly residents on Earth.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.200
I've heard that those residents 
of Heaven are goddesses.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:24.570
I've also heard that Vintage has infiltrated

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:27.710
the Loose Souls Team in pursuit of the goddesses.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.580
Is this true, Chief?

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.320
What?

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.500
Is that true?

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:36.970
Silence!

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:40.340
I am aware of these rumors.

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.090
However, we have not

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:47.410
been informed by Heaven that the
residents in question are goddesses.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.230
And I see no reason for them to hide that fact.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.950
That's true...

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.980
As for Vintage...

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:58.580
We have added new members 
to the Loose Souls Team,

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.740
but they were all thoroughly screened.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:03.530
Please refrain from baseless accusations.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.490
Let me remind you...

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:11.120
Our objective is taking loose souls into custody.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:15.050
I ask that you dedicate yourself 
to your mission at all times!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:20.630
<b>Bureau of the Peace Gift Shop</b>

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.870
<i>Maybe I'm overthinking this...</i>

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:28.560
<i>I just heard the rumor from Nora, 
but there's no actual proof.</i>

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:34.480
<i>Right, there's nothing suspicious 
about the Loose Souls Team.</i>

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:41.650
<i>We have confirmation from Bureau Chief 
Dokuro Skull, hero of Armage-machina.</i>

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.770
<i>I should trust her.</i>

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:46.540
<i>Our mission is to capture loose souls.</i>

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.140
<i>To protect New Hell.</i>

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.900
I think he'll be willing to try these.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.170
They don't look that sweet.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:58.170
<b>East 15th Exit Gate</b>

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.700
Haqua du Lot Herminium.

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:04.430
Public Safety.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:05.740
Come with us.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.140
What's going on?!

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.200
I'm leaving!

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.340
Let me go!

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:22.990
Katsuragi.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.410
What?

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.230
Tenri?

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.760
No, Diana...

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.660
I sense trouble.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.690
I wish to ask Sister Apollo 
to perform a divination.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.910
Please summon the other goddesses.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.210
What's this about—

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:35.960
Katsuragi!

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.420
Please listen to me...

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.200
Must... meet...

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.800
They're all here. Satisfied?

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.050
Thank you for doing this.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.550
I was sleeping!

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:52.310
I have to get up early tomorrow 
to shoot a drama!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:56.600
Everything we say here must be 
kept secret from our hosts.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.690
When they're asleep, they don't know 
what the goddesses are doing.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.410
Right now, Tenri is also asleep.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:04.570
But having the goddesses move around is risky.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.270
So we carried the sleeping 
hosts here with the raiment.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.630
You should have asked Haqua to do it!

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:11.530
She isn't here.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:16.240
I finally get to see my Exalted Brother, 
and he sends me on an errand.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.880
As always, your sense for danger is nil...

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:21.260
It's time to wake up, Sisters.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.380
Vulcanus,

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.200
Mars,

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.180
Minerva.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.410
Mars... Minerva...

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:34.930
I'm so glad you're okay.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.940
S-Sister!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.360
It appears that everyone is well.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:43.730
We once sacrificed our lives 
for the greater good,

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.860
and now we are reunited here...

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.420
How strange destiny is.

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.190
Enough of the emotional reunion!

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:52.300
Diana, brief them on the current situation.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:55.190
Huh? Let's give them a little time...

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.250
We can't celebrate every little happy moment!

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:00.320
Hurry up, so I can sleep.

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:01.920
I'm still sick...

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.900
Oh, you are?

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.930
You are Yui's bridegroom, aren't you?

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:09.900
I was initially against her relationship with you,

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.890
but Yui is devoted to you...

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:13.870
I've decided to support her!

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.060
Minerva?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.770
Th-This man belongs to Shiori...

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.450
Who's Shiori?

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:23.270
Shoo!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.950
Fiend...

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:27.050
You already have Tsukiyo!

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:27.700
Come on...

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:31.150
Dear Sister... This person is Yui's husband.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:32.790
Do not injure him!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.950
Katsuragi is a scoundrel, 
but I must do this for Tsukiyo.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:38.010
Forgive me, sisters, but you 
must relinquish any claims.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:39.020
I cannot do that.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.700
My friend's future is at stake!

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.710
H-He belongs to Shiori...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.720
Come on...

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.970
Sister Vul... Mars and Minerva.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.690
There's no time.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:51.540
I have something important to tell you!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.970
Something important?

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.360
This person belongs to Tenri.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.460
That isn't important!

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.040
Just get down to business!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:02.480
My younger sisters also have their wings.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.020
Huh?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.010
I'm the only one without wings.

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.980
I have recovered the least power...

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.360
Despite being the first to awaken.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.620
Uh... Diana?

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:11.620
Because you've been ignoring Tenri.

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.420
Dear Sister, you're scaring me...

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:15.530
You evil man... evil man... evil man... evil man...

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:14.590
She's too clingy.

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:16.210
Come to the second floor with me!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.870
Evil man... evil man... evil man... evil man...

00:07:16.210 --> 00:07:18.090
Once you see what's there, you'll stop arguing!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:26.070
Hydration... That makes this difficult.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:29.030
We probably cannot undo this spell.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:29.880
You can't?

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.130
Uh-uh.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.930
The spell is very difficult to remove.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.270
And if we fail, she'll turn to water permanently.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.910
Sister Apollo was ensuring that she

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.030
would not fall into enemy hands.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.150
What do we do, then?

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:48.480
We must call to her and ask her 
to undo the spell herself.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:52.600
Minerva, you have the ability 
to amplify our power.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:53.460
We need your assistance.

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.660
Everyone, call to Apollo.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:01.010
Can you hear us, Apollo?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:03.920
Return to us,

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:05.850
Apollo.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.390
Kanon!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.020
Kanon...

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.640
Elsie...

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.290
Water is coming out.

00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:24.580
Kanon...

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:25.470
Elsie!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.990
Where am I?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:53.260
This is a world of oracles that 
I created for divination.

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:56.800
Long time, no see, Kanon's beau.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:58.190
Apollo!

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:01.350
You know my name?

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:05.200
I can hear my sisters calling.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.180
I'm glad that they're all okay.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:12.820
Can you tell them I'm busy 
praying and can't go back yet?

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.090
Praying?

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:15.820
Yep, look over there.

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:21.080
The city of Maijima is filled with bad fortune...

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:25.820
So I'm working to cleanse the city.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:28.170
Will that get rid of the bad fortune?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:28.810
That's not possible.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:29.210
Huh?

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:31.560
I'm just a holy maiden.

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:34.380
All I can do is change the flow a little...

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:38.410
However, the Weiss are gaining momentum,

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.790
while we goddesses remain weak.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:44.100
The odds are against us.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.600
Any lucky break we catch will 
be worth its weight in gold.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.160
Don't do anything to disrupt me.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:55.120
A true conquest does not rely on luck.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.480
I need only make the right choices.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.340
It's that simple.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:02.120
That applies to games and reality.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:05.840
I'm only focused on achieving the best ending.

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:08.710
I believe in you.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.060
Kanon...

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:19.890
I was saved once, thanks to you...

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.580
I know that you can find a way.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:39.800
Sorry, but I can only pray 
for another three days.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.600
Once three days have passed, I'll be powerless.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.880
Be careful, Katsuragi...

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:52.700
It's not working.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.180
Sister Apollo isn't responding...

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.630
It appears she doesn't intend to return.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:02.680
We have assembled four sisters here,

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.210
all for naught...

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:07.510
Kanon, aren't you coming back?

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:08.220
Elsie...

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:08.640
Huh?

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:11.680
My cold is gone.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.270
Huh?

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:20.860
Why are you telling us to leave?

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.890
The more time you spend outside,

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:25.540
the more likely Vintage is to target your hosts.

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:29.080
I won't let what happened to 
Kanon happen to anyone else.

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.120
I-If you put it that way,

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.960
none of this has anything to do with you.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.720
This is our battle...

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:41.130
So isn't there anything we can do to help?

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.930
The power of the goddesses will be needed.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.640
Just not right now.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.740
I can handle this.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:51.640
You must protect Tenri.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.290
I u-understand.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:03.660
Tenri, I understand now...

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.650
I know why we don't have wings.

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:20.120
<b>Hell Bureau of the Peace, Far East Division</b>

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.450
<i>What did I do wrong?</i>

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:24.430
<b>Bureau, Prison Cell</b>

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:23.930
<i>Why am I locked up?</i>

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:27.050
<i>And Public Safety was involved...</i>

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:30.010
<i>They're treating me like a criminal!</i>

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:32.850
Hi...

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.820
Nora!

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.670
Don't tell anyone.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.190
Sure, take your time.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:41.760
I can't believe you blurted it 
out in the open like that.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.200
Are you an idiot?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.570
Everyone needs to know about it.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:47.260
I thought if the word were out,

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.030
it would be harder for Vintage to move around.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.700
Let's say that

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.160
there is a Vintage member

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:58.100
who holds a position of authority, with more 
influence, than we thought possible.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.340
Such as bureau chief.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.800
You were taken into custody by Public Safety, right?

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:08.640
It takes a bureau chief or 
above to command them.

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.560
Impossible!

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:17.750
It seems Vintage is more deeply rooted 
in New Hell than we thought.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.690
Then I should prepare.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.060
Bye-bye.

00:13:22.060 --> 00:13:23.280
You aren't going to help me?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.370
Huh?

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.620
Why would I help a fool like you, 
without money or connections?

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.160
Are you one of them, too?

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:32.940
I wonder...

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.990
<i>The Bureau Chief is a member of Vintage?</i>

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:43.250
<i>Then what does that mean 
for the Loose Souls Team?</i>

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.690
<i>The Festival Eve party is tonight.</i>

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.140
<b>Maijima Academy Arts and Cultural Festival [Eve]</b>

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:57.110
<i>I have to conquer Chihiro and Ayumi here.</i>

00:13:57.110 --> 00:14:00.930
<i>Before Apollo's three-day deadline, 
I must find the last goddess.</i>

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:02.510
Eh?

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:03.870
I'm signed up for the pageant?

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:04.650
Why?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.780
It's for the Prince and Princess contest 
that Mai High is famous for.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:10.900
You're the princess candidate from our class.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:12.460
Oh, sounds fun...

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.230
Go for it.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:14.660
Cut it out!

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:17.820
<i>I'm...</i>

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.920
<i>in love with you.</i>

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.730
<i>Chihiro remembers the conquest.</i>

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:25.420
<i>That means Chihiro is hosting a goddess,</i>

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:28.550
<i>and there is no goddess inside Ayumi.</i>

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.920
<i>Then why would Ayumi visit me?</i>

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:35.810
<i>I thought perhaps she fell for me without 
remembering her conquest until...</i>

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.930
<i>Be nice to Chihiro.</i>

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:40.670
<i>...she suddenly put on the brakes.</i>

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:42.560
<i>Was it because she heard Chihiro's confession?</i>

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:47.570
<i>I can't conquer either of them if they 
trigger flags that I can't anticipate.</i>

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:50.070
<i>I must control all flags.</i>

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:50.990
<b>Maijima Academy Arts and Cultural Festival [Eve]</b>

00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:51.680
<i>There's no time.</i>

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.080
<i>I'll have to go with the more likely candidate.</i>

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:57.330
The weather's getting cold, 
and meat buns are tasting good.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.830
This year's Mai High Prince and 
Princess contest is stacked!

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:02.340
We have handsome boys and 
pretty girls across the board.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:03.840
Grab a ballot now!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.320
The results will be announced 
during the after-party.

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.500
What are you doing, bastard?!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:16.570
Only amateurs would exclude game 
characters from a pageant.

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:17.850
Behold her loveliness...

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:20.850
Yuimi, from <i>Magic Academy Carmine</i>,

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.030
is the favorite.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.570
You're so stupid.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.940
You do this everywhere you go.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.610
What does it matter to you?

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:34.590
My PFP is gone...

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:35.370
Where is it?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.370
Huh? Where'd it go?

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:37.370
Sounds like karma to me.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:41.140
It's what you get for making fun of the festival 
just because you have no one to take.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.770
Neither do you.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:45.500
I'm performing this time, stupid!

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:47.790
Oh, that's right.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.170
Thanks for dropping by yesterday...

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:55.170
Yeah, I'm glad to see you're better now.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:00.210
Found it. This is it, right?

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.140
Yeah!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.260
<b>Festival Eve Campfire</b>

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.260
Twice as Big as Last Year's

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.260
The Flames of Love will Burn.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.720
Hey!

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:09.840
Katsuragi, you'll be dateless at 
the Mai High Festival, right?

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.400
Are you trying to rub it in my face?

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.820
In that case...

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.150
Why not go with me to

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.620
the campfire tonight?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.030
<i>Chihiro invited me first?</i>

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:25.490
<b>Festival Eve Campfire</b>

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:25.490
Twice as Big as Last Year's

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:25.490
The Flames of Love will Burn.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:25.090
<i>I'd planned to use the posters 
as an excuse to invite her.</i>

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:27.890
<i>But I have no reason to turn her down.</i>

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.460
Yes or no?

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.930
S-Sure...

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:34.670
Then I'll see you later.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.300
<i>Everything's going well.</i>

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:43.700
<i>If the goddess is inside Chihiro, 
everything will be over.</i>

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.150
<i>But first...</i>

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:49.860
Chihiro may act like a cynic, but she's 
more innocent than you'd think.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.710
You have to be nice to her.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:54.010
I know that.

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:56.620
<i>She's still talking about Chihiro.</i>

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:00.400
Watch this.

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:01.830
Huh?

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:07.400
Katsuragi... Taking out garbage, too?

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.130
Yeah.

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:11.150
Chihiro, did you know?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.530
They say something good

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.950
will happen if two people bring the same 
thing to the Festival Eve event.

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:17.860
The same thing?

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.470
But I don't have anything on me now, 
since I'm in my PE uniform.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:22.640
Katsuragi...

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:23.780
Hmm?

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:24.770
Put out your hand.

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.110
What? What did you put inside?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.840
It's a used one, but would you 
hold on to it for now?

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.120
Is this...

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.260
a guitar pick?

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:44.500
Looks like that worked out, Katsuragi.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.570
You're not mad, Ayumi?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:47.370
Hmm?

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:51.630
I just wanted to see how Ayumi 
would react one last time...

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.070
If Ayumi was mad after seeing Chihiro with me,

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:57.130
it'd mean she still had some level of affection,

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.450
so she could still host a goddess.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.260
Huh? What are you muttering about?

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:06.230
I plan on kissing Chihiro today.

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.560
There's no turning back.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.020
This is your last chance to get mad at me.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:15.560
Why would I be mad?

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:17.470
Be nice to Chihiro!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.370
A new song?

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.310
We're performing in two days.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:26.220
Well, we don't have to play this song,

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:27.370
but I managed to finish it.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:31.500
<i>This is the song she was humming.</i>

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:34.100
A Chihiro original, huh?

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.960
Don't play the song!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.190
It's embarrassing...

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:40.390
We can't practice without playing it.

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.250
Well, I'll see you girls tonight.

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:44.010
Yeah.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:45.700
See you later.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.780
Ayumi, do you have a minute?

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:49.270
I need to talk to you.

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:52.080
Sorry, but I have something to take care of.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.420
Man...

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.780
Chihiro, you have a date with 
Katsuragi at Festival Eve, right?

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.200
Good luck.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.110
Bye!

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.120
How does she know?

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.620
Welcome to Festival Eve!

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.370
The Mai High Prince and Princess 
contest will begin at six, on stage!

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.270
The campfire is scheduled to start at seven!

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:15.760
There's Festival Eve, the festival, 
and the after-party.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:18.260
Why is so much effort put into cultural festivals?

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:22.350
The Mai High Festival has existed 
since the school was founded.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:23.010
Ni—

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.050
Nikaido!

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:25.890
Why are you wearing those ears?

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.790
The teachers are performing 
in a Festival Eve play.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:32.900
I'm one of Dharma the Devil's henchmen.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.380
Pure idiocy...

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:37.150
I swear she's enjoying it.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:38.490
Katsuragi!

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:41.060
Did you wait long?

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.660
Sorry for being late...

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:49.660
It's finally time for the Mai High 
Prince and Princess contest!

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:00.280
<i>My conquest of Chihiro is 
going according to plan.</i>

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:02.160
<i>The ending is close.</i>

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:07.260
<i>But if I kiss her here and her wings 
appear, Vintage could notice.</i>

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.790
<i>I need to take her to an 
isolated area and kiss her!</i>

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:12.520
Here she is!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:13.320
Adorable!

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.260
Ayumi!

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:19.280
Our princess contestant from 
Class 2-B is Ayumi Takahara!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.370
<i>I'm so embarrassed.</i>

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.530
I'm voting for her.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.090
Is Ayumi popular?

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.490
You didn't know?

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:33.000
Let's go to the campfire!

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.050
Katsuragi, did you bring the pick?

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.110
Yeah.

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.320
I have a feeling that something good

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:51.180
will happen at this year's festival.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.310
<i>Time to start my mission!</i>

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:56.600
The crowd is getting to me.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.320
Can we find somewhere quiet?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:01.150
No way... They just started the fire.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.530
<i>That's why!</i>

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.070
<i>Everyone is gravitating here, so 
other places are emptying out!</i>

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:07.400
The fire won't go out for a while.

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:09.860
How about we go look at the posters outside?

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:12.540
I'm okay with that.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.840
<b>Soccer Club</b>

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.840
<i>There are still people here, too.</i>

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.470
<i>Maybe behind the library...</i>

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.020
Let's have a look over here.

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.540
It seems a little dark...

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.290
Not really, there's a good spot—

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:34.650
I'll pass!

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:37.860
I don't want you taking me somewhere 
deserted and grabbing at me.

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:40.320
<i>I'll have to be pushy about this.</i>

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:42.280
Wait... Katsuragi?

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:52.820
Um...

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:55.360
<i>What's with all these people?</i>

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:57.750
<i>I'm in the middle of an important event!</i>

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:00.180
K-Katsuragi?

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.450
<i>No good, I have to start over.</i>

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:09.360
Let's head back to the track field.

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:14.020
It's okay.

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:17.750
Let's find somewhere without others.

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:51.060
<b>The following is to be punished for treason:</b>

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:54.990
<b>Haqua du Lot Herminium.</b>

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:57.240
Yes, give me all of her logs.

00:23:57.760 --> 00:23:59.750
Yes, the one who was punished,

00:24:00.610 --> 00:24:03.040
Haqua du Lot Herminium.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:07.460
It's Festival Eve. Location is the school.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:08.320
All flags have been triggered.

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:09.490
All parameters are go.

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:11.070
The preparations for my 
conquest are complete.

00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:14.320
I'll conquer Chihiro, bring out her goddess, 
go home, and play games.

00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:16.970
I'm not wasting another minute 
on the real world!

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:20.060
Huh? Did you say something, Katsuragi?
